  {
    "id": "tweet_geonews_urdu_2339462936389459770",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "geonews_urdu",
    "text": "The tripartite defense agreement between Pakistan, Turkey, and Saudi Arabia is also a response to Israel's aggression, and this agreement also nullifies the discourse on the Abraham Accords, says international affairs expert Adil Najam.",
    "translated_text": "国际事务专家阿迪尔·纳贾姆表示，巴基斯坦、土耳其和沙特阿拉伯之间的三方防务协议也是对以色列侵略的回应，该协议也使《亚伯拉罕协议》的话语无效。",
    "images": [
      "85babbbbc4c8f554.jpg"
    ],
    "url": "https://x.com/geonews_urdu/status/2339462936389459770",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-08T22:35:50.358006+00:00",
