  },
  {
    "id": "tweet_geonews_urdu_-8455905511022441733",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "geonews_urdu",
    "text": "Under the Constitution, the President, Prime Minister, and Cabinet are bound to act on the advice of the Cabinet. The approval for the appointment of additional judges was given unanimously by the Judicial Commission. Decisions cannot be made according to anyone's whims,",
    "translated_text": "根据宪法，总统、总理和内阁有义务根据内阁的建议行事。司法委员会一致批准任命额外法官​​。不能根据任何人的一时兴起做出决定",
    "images": [
      "c8f277be5cc13ccd.jpg"
    ],
    "url": "https://x.com/geonews_urdu/status/-8455905511022441733",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-08T22:35:50.624184+00:00",
    "original_time": "2026-08-08T18:13:22+00:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "tweet_geonews_urdu_-5980513273572774372",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "geonews_urdu",
    "text": "Peaceful protest is everyone's right, but PTI's protests are not peaceful. Imran Khan has all facilities in jail, lawyers should be allowed to meet him, whatever decision the court gives, we will accept it, Barrister Aqil Malik",
    "translated_text": "和平抗议是每个人的权利，但 PTI 的抗议并不和平。伊姆兰·汗监狱里设施齐全，应该允许律师会见他，无论法庭做出什么决定，我们都会接受，大律师阿基尔·马利克",
    "images": [
      "110825b10a92f92c.jpg"
    ],
    "url": "https://x.com/geonews_urdu/status/-5980513273572774372",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-08T22:35:50.907906+00:00",
    "original_time": "2026-08-08T18:13:16+00:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "tweet_geonews_urdu_8464407821469848657",
